+ * Versions 0.7 through 1.0.0 were in the range 0 to 100 here (only
+ * version 1.0.0 was mis-numbered 100 instead of 10000).  From
+ * version 1.0.1 it's    xxyyzz, where x=major, y=minor, z=release
